2. The Hunspell dictionary in the npm package dictionary-ko@2.0.0
   (hunspell-dict-ko, https://github.com/spellcheck-ko/hunspell-dict-ko). Its word
   data is CC BY-SA (2.0 KR / 4.0); see its licence file.

